# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw source media — deliberately NOT committed.
#
# These are the unedited originals: 14 photographs and 10 videos of a real
# person, 27 MB at full original resolution, including clips the site does not
# use (12.19.56.mp4 alone is 11.4 MB).
#
# This repo is a GitHub Pages user site, which is public. Committing these
# would publish the un-cropped, un-rotated, full-quality originals to the open
# internet — a different thing from the processed, web-sized versions the site
# actually serves, which live in 2026/assets/.
#
# The files remain on disk. To version them, use a private repository, or
# commit them locally on a branch that is never pushed:
#   git add -f "pictures and video"
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
